options = {"batch": "support", "notes": {"source_review": "agent_docs/SANDBOX_SUPPORT_SOURCE_REVIEW.md", "source_scene": "res://assets/vfx/sources/4b8091de77ad9c81f5a6/vfx_status_divine.tscn", "palette_source": "recipes/spells/bless.json#/profiles/finishing/colors", "source_recipe_anchor": "target_ground", "units_and_lifetime": "Native application source cylinder remains1.2375cells high and floor aligned. Original pending.bless application_fade_ms1500/2000 defines the 1.5-2s handoff: native application fades to zero at2s; native sustain material projects onto the recipient body from1.5s. The body-only preview lasts3.6s with0.35s final fade, preserving prior total5.1s. Hidden sustain geometry creates no cage or floor seal.", "qualification": "Native material/data reuse reviewed. Actual four-view body-mask, native colour/clock and depth/normal qualification required after import. No backend conditions, healing, rolls or expiration are simulated.", "full_side": "Full native scene requires the importer full-side branch in copied recipient/blessing.gd; the source override otherwise inserts an export half-space even for side=full.", "user_correction_2026_10_14": "Preserve the full application and use an explicit0.05 quiet sustained opacity alongside the original native envelope. Lower only the cylinder Mesh by0.1388889 source units: (1.25 −0.1388889×0.9 −2.5×0.9/2)×0.55=0. The separate BrokenGroundBlessing stays at its authored ground registration; no floor translation or clipping workaround. Isolated Sustain starts at the quiet level; decorative room illumination is disabled. The explicit opacity_uniform=support_envelope multiplies each sampled native shader envelope; it must restore that native baseline before resampling, rather than compounding the previous display fade.", "user_correction_2026_10_15": "The four-view .18 hold remained too prominent because native source emission also contributes. Lower only the sustained multiplier to .05 in Sequence, isolated Lifecycle and isolated Sustain. Keep full opening, native colour, source timing, floor registration and close unchanged. This authoring value requires its own four-view visual review; the earlier 792-check report qualifies the .18 pass.", "user_correction_2026_10_15_body": "The user explicitly rejected the remaining .05 cage: sustain now reuses the shared False Life body_surface path and the actual Bless effect/Donor/Mesh noise texture, post-Factory colours, animated support_clock and support_envelope. All sustain source geometry is hidden; no extra light. Nominal strength1 and authored opacity.25 multiply the native.49 envelope once for.1225 max. Initial cast/native application remains, with the original1.5-2s application crossfade from game_obsolete/data/condition-media.json. Historical .18/.05 measurements above are prior rejected presentations, not current sustain."}}
